# Event-driven external waits

When CI or Jira work requires waiting, do not poll, use `--watch`, retry with
sleep, or keep reasoning until a status changes. The signed delivery is an
observability signal only; it does not prove that a CI run or Jira item is
complete. The production webhooks are already configured at:

- `https://agent-waiter.vercel.app/api/github`
- `https://agent-waiter.vercel.app/api/jira`

A single read-only diagnostic lookup is allowed at the decision point before
declaring completion. Do not repeat lookups while waiting.
